},{"text":"3–5 Strong Studio / Portfolio Projects"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Relevant Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio should contain"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Complete Residential / Institutional Building"},{"type":"h","text":"2. BIM-Based Building Project"},{"type":"h","text":"3. Sustainable / Climate-Responsive Building"},{"type":"h","text":"4. Urban or Mixed-Use Development"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Computational / Parametric Design Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brief"},{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Design concept"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Plans"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"Details"},{"text":"3D views"},{"text":"Material strategy"},{"text":"Environmental strategy"},{"text":"Final outcome"},{"text":"A portfolio should demonstrate design thinking and technical competence, not just attractive renders."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest modern positioning is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Architect specializing in architectural design, BIM, sustainable building systems and digital architectural workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal career equation is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Building Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CAD / BIM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3D Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Computational Design"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Project Coordination","ARCHITECT"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a technology-oriented architecture career, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architectural Design","Revit/BIM","Construction Documentation","Sustainable Design","Visualization","Computational Design."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates pathways into Architectural Practice, BIM Architecture, Sustainable Architecture, Computational Design, Urban Design, Digital Architecture, Architectural Project Management and Building Performance."}]}]}